WEBVTT

00:03:57.857 --> 00:04:00.439
and we might enter into a permanent slump.

00:04:00.463 --> 00:04:02.361
And that fear is compounded by the fact

00:04:02.385 --> 00:04:05.506
that age is seldom seen
as an asset in the modern workplace.

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:06.705
Far too often,

00:04:06.729 --> 00:04:09.788
our older colleagues don't get
the respect they deserve.

00:04:09.812 --> 00:04:12.743
Arthur's slump happened
at a particularly early age,

00:04:12.767 --> 00:04:16.189
so he changed careers
and became a public policy expert.

00:04:16.213 --> 00:04:19.173
AB: Basically I'm just an old fashioned,

00:04:19.197 --> 00:04:22.546
number-crunching, quantitative
social scientist.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.188
AG: Given what he's gone through,

00:04:24.212 --> 00:04:27.236
it's not entirely surprising
that his big area of focus now

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.910
is career decline.

00:04:28.934 --> 00:04:34.593
AB: Career decline is a very personal
and personalized phenomenon